 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2023-03-28",
   "text": "Prostate-Specific Antigen Screening for High-risk Insured Men Act or the PSA Screening for HIM Act\n\n This bill requires private health insurance plans to cover preventive prostate cancer screenings that are not already covered under the recommendations of the U.S. Preventive Services Task Force for men with a family history of prostate cancer, without imposing any cost-sharing requirement."
  }
